    "articleEn": "Theme: A young keeper cares for growing animals and learns how they survive.\n\nLeo worked at a small animal sanctuary near a school field. After a short game of {{cricket}} with his friends, he went back inside to {{feed}} the creatures. Each animal had special dietary needs. They needed meals rich in {{protein}} and every essential {{vitamin}} to keep their {{metabolism}} working well. Leo first visited a rescued fox resting in a warm pen. It had thick {{fur}}, but an injured {{paw}} and a broken {{claw}} made walking difficult. A stiff {{bristle}} stood up on its back as Leo watched the tired animal {{curl}} into a tight ball to sleep.\n\nOutside, tiny forms of life filled the sunlit garden. A bright {{butterfly}} danced over the flowers, while a patient {{spider}} sat quietly in the middle of its web. However, not every small creature was harmless. An annoying {{mosquito}} landed on Leo’s bare {{skin}}, searching for blood. Leo quickly brushed away the little {{pest}} before it could bite him. Such bugs could act like a dangerous {{parasite}}, spreading illness among the animals. If these harmful creatures were allowed to {{proliferate}} without any control, the entire garden would suffer. Nearby, a wild bird used its hard {{beak}} to {{devour}} a wriggling {{worm}} and a fat {{insect}}.\n\nThe sanctuary also protected rare birds. Leo admired an exotic crane as it stretched each wide {{wing}}. It shook every clean {{feather}}, proudly displaying a long, elegant {{plume}} on its head. Today was a very special time for the cranes. Two adults were performing a graceful {{courtship}} dance across the grass. Leo hoped the pair would {{mate}} naturally this week. In a few days, the female would {{lay}} eggs in a safe nest, protect her precious {{brood}} from the cold, and wait for the chicks to {{hatch}}.\n\nNext, Leo checked the freshwater pond where endangered fish lived. A large trout moved its clear {{fin}} smoothly through the cool water. It was the perfect season for the fish to {{spawn}} among the clean stones. Leo worked hard to preserve this special river {{breed}}. He had to ensure that different groups did not {{interbreed}} by accident. If two distant species began to {{hybridize}}, their young could suffer from genetic {{sterility}} and fail to produce offspring. Leo wanted all the young fish to {{mature}} safely so that their wild population could grow again.\n\nIn the warm amphibian house, tiny frogs sat on moist green leaves. Certain frogs could {{secrete}} a bitter liquid onto their bodies to keep enemies away, and like all living things, they would regularly {{excrete}} waste to stay healthy. Leo smiled as he finished his daily tasks. Looking after these animals taught him that every detail, from the smallest bug to the largest bird, was part of a wonderful cycle of life.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 一位年轻的饲养员照料成长中的动物，并了解它们的生存方式。\n\n利奥在学校操场旁的一家小型动物保护区工作。和朋友们玩了一会儿板球后，他回到室内去喂养那里的动物。每种动物都有特殊的饮食需求。它们需要富含蛋白质和各种必需维生素的食物，以保持良好的新陈代谢。利奥首先探望了一只在温暖圈舍里休养的获救狐狸。它有着厚厚的软毛，但受伤的脚掌和折断的爪让它行走困难。当利奥看着这只疲惫的动物卷曲成一个紧凑的毛球睡觉时，它背上的一根硬鬃毛竖了起来。\n\n室外，阳光明媚的花园里充满了微小的生命。一只鲜艳的蝴蝶在花丛上翩翩起舞，而一只耐心的蜘蛛正静静地守在蛛网中央。然而，并非所有小生灵都是无害的。一只讨厌的蚊子落在了利奥裸露的皮肤上寻找血液。利奥迅速赶走了这只小害虫，以免被叮咬。这种小虫可能会像危险的寄生虫一样在动物之间传播疾病。如果放任这些有害生物毫无节制地迅速增殖，整个花园都会遭殃。在不远处，一只野生鸟类用它坚硬的喙来吞食一条扭动的蠕虫和一只肥胖的昆虫。\n\n保护区还庇护着珍稀鸟类。利奥欣赏着一只珍奇的鹤，它伸展着宽大的翅膀，抖动着身上的每一片羽毛，骄傲地展示着头顶那根优雅的长羽毛。今天对这些鹤来说是一个非常特殊的日子。两只成鸟正在草地上跳着优雅的求偶舞。利奥希望这对鸟儿本周能自然交配。几天之内，雌鸟就会在安全的巢里产卵，悉心守护这一窝幼鸟的蛋免受严寒，等待幼鸟顺利孵化。\n\n接着，利奥检查了生活着濒危鱼类的淡水池塘。一条大鳟鱼在清凉的水中平稳地摆动它透明的鳍。眼下正是鱼儿在洁净碎石间产卵的绝佳季节。利奥努力保护这一特殊的河流品种。他必须确保不同种群不会意外杂交。如果两个不同的物种开始杂交，它们的后代可能会面临遗传性的不生育问题，无法繁衍后代。利奥希望所有幼鱼都能安全成熟，这样野生种群才能再次壮大。\n\n在温暖的两栖动物馆里，小青蛙趴在湿润的绿叶上。某些青蛙能从体内分泌出一种苦涩的液体以驱赶天敌；而且与所有生物一样，它们会定期排泄废物以保持健康。利奥微笑着完成了当天的日常工作。照料这些动物让他明白，从最小的昆虫到最大的鸟类，每一个细节都是美妙生命循环的一部分。",
