    "articleEn": "Theme: A park keeper visits animals from different habitats before guests arrive.\n\nLeo worked at a giant animal park called World Haven. At sunrise, the loud cry of a {{cock}} woke him up. He walked past the park entrance, which had a beautiful wooden carving of a mythical {{dragon}}. First, he inspected the farm area. A worker adjusted a heavy leather {{harness}} on a strong {{ox}}, while another placed a soft {{saddle}} on a brown {{horse}}. Nearby, a patient {{donkey}} stood beside a striped {{zebra}}. In the open field, a large herd of {{cattle}} grazed peacefully. A muscular {{bull}} with a sharp curved {{horn}} watched over a playful young {{calf}}, while a heavy {{buffalo}} rested in the cool mud. In the barn corner, a gentle sheep fed her little {{lamb}}.\n\nLeo then walked down the quiet path where smaller creatures lived. A fast {{hare}} darted across the grass, startling a tiny brown {{mouse}} and a gray {{rat}} hiding by the grain sacks. Up in a tall oak, a busy {{squirrel}} hid nuts in the bark, while a bright green {{frog}} jumped into a pond. Gracefully floating on the water was a pure white {{swan}}, followed closely by a noisy {{goose}}. Above the pond, a swift {{swallow}} caught insects in the air, a tiny {{sparrow}} hopped on the fence, a gray {{pigeon}} searched for breadcrumbs, and a dark {{crow}} called from a wooden post.\n\nNext, Leo entered the cool forest zone. High in a hollow tree, a sleepy {{owl}} blinked at him. In the rocky cliffs above, impressive birds ruled the sky: a noble {{eagle}} circled overhead, while a fierce {{hawk}} and a swift {{falcon}} rested on high branches. Down below, a mother {{bear}} walked with her playful {{cub}}, showing it how to find sweet roots. Nearby, a clever red {{fox}} trotted silently through the bushes, keeping away from the distant territory of a grey {{wolf}}. In a quiet bamboo grove, a giant black-and-white {{panda}} sat comfortably, chewing fresh green shoots.\n\nLeo then reached the warm savannah and desert habitats. A tall {{camel}} walked calmly across the sand, perfectly suited for the dry heat. Across the fence on the grass, an energetic {{kangaroo}} leaped past with huge jumps. Further ahead, a majestic African {{elephant}} sprayed refreshing water over its back with its long {{trunk}}. Leo admired its magnificent tusks, thinking how important it was to protect wild animals so their valuable {{ivory}} is never taken by hunters.\n\nFinally, Leo visited the water pavilions. In the deep sea pool, a giant blue {{whale}} surfaced and blew a tall fountain of mist into the air. Beside the pool, a green sea {{turtle}} glided smoothly through the water, while a slow land {{tortoise}} rested on the dry bank. In the icy indoor area, a cheerful {{penguin}} waddled across the snow, and a sleek mother {{seal}} lovingly nudged her newborn {{pup}}. Leo smiled and closed his morning checklist. Every animal was safe and happy, and the park was ready to open its gates.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 公园管理员在游客到达前探望来自不同栖息地的动物。\n\n利奥在一家名叫“世界家园”的大型动物园工作。日出时分，一只公鸡嘹亮的啼叫声唤醒了他。他走过公园大门，门上刻着一条神话中龙的精美木雕。首先，他检查了农场区域。一名工人正在一头强壮的公牛身上调整沉重的皮质马具，而另一名工人则将柔软的马鞍放在一匹棕马的背上。在旁边，一头耐心的驴子站在一匹条纹斑马身旁。开阔的草地上，一大群牛正在安静地吃草。一头长着尖锐弯曲角的强壮公牛看护着一只淘气的小牛，而一头沉重的水牛正在凉爽的泥浆里休息。在谷仓角落里，一只温和的母羊正在喂养她的小羔羊。\n\n随后，利奥走在安静的小路上，那里生活着许多小型生物。一只敏捷的野兔飞快地穿过草地，惊吓到了躲在粮食袋旁的一只棕色小老鼠和一只灰色老鼠。在高高的橡树上，一只忙碌的松鼠把坚果藏在树皮里，而一只翠绿的青蛙跳进了池塘。一只纯白色的天鹅在水面上优雅地漂游，身后紧跟着一只吵闹的鹅。池塘上方，一只敏捷的燕子在空中捕捉昆虫，一只小麻雀在栅栏上跳跃，一只灰鸽子在寻找面包屑，一只黑乌鸦则在木桩上啼叫。\n\n接着，利奥走进了凉爽的森林区。在一棵空心树的高处，一只困倦的猫头鹰对他眨着眼睛。在上方陡峭的岩壁上，令人惊叹的猛禽统治着天空：一只高贵的雕在头顶盘旋，而一只凶猛的鹰和一只迅捷的猎鹰停在高高的树枝上。在下方地面上，一只母熊带着她顽皮的幼兽散步，教它如何寻找甘甜的植物根茎。附近，一只聪明的赤狐狸静悄悄地穿过灌木丛，远离远处灰狼的领地。在安静的竹林里，一只黑白相间的大熊猫舒服地坐着，咀嚼着新鲜的嫩竹。\n\n随后，利奥来到了温暖的稀树草原与沙漠展区。一头高大的骆驼从容地穿过沙地，极适应干燥炎热的环境。隔着栅栏的草地上，一只精力充沛的袋鼠大步跳跃而过。再往前看，一头威严的非洲大象用长长的象鼻将清爽的水喷向自己的背部。利奥欣赏着它宏伟的长牙，心想保护野生动物是多么重要，这样珍贵的象牙才不会被猎人夺走。\n\n最后，利奥来到了水生馆。在深海池中，一头巨大的蓝鲸浮出水面，向空中喷出高高的水雾。水池旁，一只绿海龟在水中平稳地滑行，而一只行动迟缓的陆龟则在干燥的岸边休息。在寒冷的室内冰雪区，一只快活的企鹅在雪地上摇摇摆摆地走着，一只光滑的母海豹慈爱地轻碰着她刚出生的幼崽。利奥微笑着合上了他的清晨检查清单。每种动物都平安快乐，公园也准备好敞开大门迎接客人了。",
