    "articleEn": "Theme: A student explores campus buildings and library materials to choose his university major.\n\nLeo moved into his new university {{accommodation}} in September. His room in the student {{dorm}} was small, but it was close to both the main {{dining hall}} and the basement {{canteen}}. Today, Leo faced a big decision. He had to pick his {{major}} and choose a {{minor}} before the weekend. His online student {{profile}} was not finished, and his university {{record}} needed these final choices soon.\n\nAfter breakfast, Leo went to the science building. Inside the bright {{laboratory}}, a team was doing a chemistry {{experiment}}. They tested each small {{object}} carefully, measured the exact {{quantity}} of liquid, and checked the high {{quality}} of their results. Leo looked at the computer screens filled with scientific {{data}}. An assistant gave him a user {{manual}} and an equipment {{inventory}}. Leo touched the metal {{frame}} of the test machine. Science was an exciting {{subject}}, but was it truly right for him?\n\nLeo walked over to the quiet campus {{library}} to think. He sat at a terminal and opened the digital {{catalogue}}. He clicked on each {{category}} of study, and an alphabetical {{index}} showed him a long {{list}} of titles. On a shelf, he found a heavy {{volume}} of an old {{encyclopedia}} and checked its table of {{content}}. The wide {{coverage}} of general knowledge impressed him, but he wanted something more creative.\n\nHe moved to the {{literature}} section, and his mood immediately lifted. Leo loved reading. He picked up a popular work of {{fiction}} and an ancient folk {{tale}}. Every great {{author}} knew how to tell a moving {{story}}, whether through classic {{poetry}} or in an honest {{biography}}. Leo also saw a science {{journal}}, an art {{magazine}}, and an informative news {{article}} on a table. At the back of a paper, he checked the detailed {{bibliography}} to see the sources.\n\nNext, Leo visited the media room. A teacher was showing an old film {{reel}} from a historical {{documentary}} {{series}}. Seeing those moving images gave the old books important historical {{context}}. Leo sat down, opened his personal {{diary}}, and made a quick pencil {{sketch}} of the campus view. He took a paper {{file}} from his bag and wrote a neat {{draft}} of his plan.\n\nFinally, Leo felt confident. A colorful program {{brochure}} explained the last registration steps. He decided to focus on books and keep science as his second interest. As he walked outside, Leo smiled, knowing that tomorrow would begin an exciting new {{chapter}} in his life.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 一名学生探索校园建筑和图书馆资料，以选择他的大学专业。\n\n九月，利奥搬进了他在大学的新住处。他在学生宿舍里的房间虽然不大，但离主餐厅和地下室的食堂都很近。今天，利奥面临着一个重大决定。他必须在周末前选定自己的主修专业并挑好一门辅修专业。他的在线学生个人资料尚未完善，而他的大学学籍档案很快就需要这些最终的选择。\n\n早饭后，利奥去了理科楼。在明亮的实验室里，一个团队正在做化学实验。他们仔细测试每一个小物体，精确测量液体的数量，并检查实验结果的高质量。利奥看着满是科学数据的电脑屏幕。一名助理递给他一本使用手册和一份设备清单。利奥摸了摸测试仪器的金属框架。科学是一门令人兴奋的学科，但它真的适合自己吗？\n\n利奥走向安静的校园图书馆去思考。他坐在一台终端机前，打开了电子目录。他点击了每一个研究门类，一个按字母排序的索引向他展示了长长的书名列表。在书架上，他找到了一本厚重的旧百科全书，翻阅了它的目录。其包罗万象的通识知识覆盖面让他印象深刻，但他想要一些更具创造性的东西。\n\n他走到文学区，心情立刻好转起来。利奥热爱阅读。他拿出一本畅销小说和一本古老的民间故事。每一位伟大的作者都懂得如何讲述一个动人的故事，不论是通过古典诗歌，还是在一本真挚的传记中。利奥还在桌上看到了一本科学期刊、一本艺术杂志和一篇内容丰富的新闻报道。在论文末尾，他查看了详细的参考文献以了解资料来源。\n\n接着，利奥来到了媒体室。一位老师正在放映一部历史纪录片****系列的老胶片卷。看到那些动态的影像，让古老的书籍拥有了重要的历史背景。利奥坐下来，打开他的个人日记，用铅笔快速勾勒了一幅校园风景速写。他从包里拿出一个纸质文件夹，工整地写下了自己计划的草稿。\n\n最后，利奥感到信心十足。一份彩色的项目宣传册解释了最后的注册步骤。他决定专注于书籍，将科学作为自己的第二兴趣。当他走到室外时，利奥露出了微笑，他知道明天将开启人生令人兴奋的崭新篇章。",
