    "articleEn": "Theme: Two inventors work together to create a helpful new tool.\n\nLiam studied at a famous {{polytechnic}} institute. He worked hard because he wanted to become a skilled {{engineer}}. His uncle, Marco, worked as an experienced {{mechanic}} in a city garage. Together, they shared a deep interest in modern {{technology}}. Liam always wanted to {{innovate}} and build something helpful. To build a strong {{foundation}} for his dreams, he decided to {{specialise}} in clean energy. He tried to {{absorb}} every lesson from his books and {{concentrate}} on his work every evening.\n\nLiam’s favorite {{field}} was clean transport. Marco, on the other hand, worked in the practical {{domain}} of repairing old vehicles. Soon, their shared ideas entered the exciting {{realm}} of invention. Liam decided to {{devise}} a small tool to help drivers save fuel. It was a clever little {{gizmo}} that monitored how an engine burned fuel. To build the frame, Liam learned a difficult welding {{technique}} from Marco. He knew he had to {{focus}} on making the tool easy and safe for everyone.\n\nMarco agreed to be the chief {{tester}} for the first model. He wanted to {{utilise}} the device on an old delivery van. However, during daily {{usage}}, the device suddenly shut down. They had to {{uncover}} the mystery behind the sudden failure. They carefully opened the box, trying not to {{expose}} the sensitive parts to dust. After checking each part, they managed to {{discover}} a tiny loose wire near the battery.\n\nLiam chose not to {{disclose}} details about the failure to anyone outside the shop. Instead, he worked quietly to {{apply}} a stronger connection to the wire. When they switched the power back on, the small screen began to {{reveal}} bright green lights and perfect data. This success was a true {{breakthrough}} for both of them. Their hard work marked a great {{advance}} in their project.\n\nFinally, Marco told Liam it was time to apply for an official {{patent}} to protect their hard work. Many local drivers soon heard about the invention and wanted to try it. Liam smiled happily in the workshop, knowing that great tools begin with patience, teamwork, and careful testing.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 两位发明家携手打造一款实用新工具。\n\n利亚姆在一所著名的理工学院学习。他学习十分刻苦，因为他想成为一名熟练的工程师。他的叔叔马可是在市区一家汽车修理厂工作的资深机械师。他们都对现代科技怀有浓厚的兴趣。利亚姆一直渴望创新，并打造出有用的东西。为了给自己的梦想打下坚实的基础，他决定专攻清洁能源。他努力汲取书本上的每一堂课，并于每天晚上全神贯注于自己的工作。\n\n利亚姆最喜欢的领域是清洁交通。而马可则在旧车维修这一实用范畴工作。不久，他们共同的想法进入了令人兴奋的发明天地。利亚姆决定设计一个小工具，以帮助驾驶员节约燃油。这是一个巧妙的小装置，可以监测发动机燃烧燃油的情况。为了制作框架，利亚姆向马可学习了一种高难度的焊接技术。他知道自己必须聚焦于让这个工具对每个人来说都简单且安全。\n\n马可同意担任第一台原型的首席测试员。他想在一辆旧送货面包车上使用该设备。然而，在日常使用过程中，设备突然关机了。他们必须揭开这次突发故障背后的秘密。他们小心翼翼地打开外壳，尽量不让敏感部件暴露在灰尘中。在检查了每个部件之后，他们终于发现了电池附近一根松动的小电线。\n\n利亚姆选择不向车间外的任何人透露关于这次失败的细节。相反，他默默地努力为电线应用了更牢固的连接。当他们重新打开电源时，小屏幕开始显示出明亮的绿灯和完美的数据。这次成功对他们两人来说都是真正的突破。他们的辛勤付出标志着项目取得了一次巨大的进展。\n\n最后，马可告诉利亚姆，是时候申请一项正式专利来保护他们的辛勤劳动成果了。当地的许多司机很快听说了这项发明并跃跃欲试。利亚姆在工坊里开心地笑了，他明白伟大的工具始于耐心、团队合作和严谨的测试。",
