    "articleEn": "Theme: People gather at a sports center to train, compete, and enjoy different games.\n\nLeo was a young {{athlete}} who dreamed of joining an {{Olympic}} team one day. This weekend, his town held a big sports {{tournament}}. A rich local {{patron}} and a company {{sponsor}} gave money for prizes. Every {{spectator}} sat in the huge {{stadium}} to watch the open {{competition}}. A kind {{volunteer}} handed out water bottles to keep everyone cool.\n\nThe town center had both an {{indoor}} hall and an {{outdoor}} park. Inside the warm {{gym}}, older players enjoyed quiet games of {{chess}} and {{billiards}} on green tables. Nearby, people did slow {{yoga}} to relax their minds, taking time to {{stretch}} their arms carefully so they would not {{strain}} any muscles. Others preferred a {{vigorous}} workout with heavy weights, while an {{energetic}} coach led a quick body {{movement}} class. Leo watched them {{exercise}} every morning during his own daily {{training}}.\n\nOutside, many sports were happening at the same time across the wide grass {{sprawl}}. One field was set up for {{soccer}}, where players ran fast to {{kick}} the ball and score a nice {{goal}}. Next to them, teams played {{volleyball}} over a tall net, while another group played {{hockey}} on the turf. In the corner, players used a heavy {{bat}} for {{cricket}}, while others went to a nearby green to practice {{golf}}. Players with a light {{racket}} rushed between {{badminton}} and {{tennis}} matches. Leo had to {{toss}} a coin to start each game and saw the coin {{flip}} high in the air.\n\nSuddenly, dark clouds appeared. Leo had to {{motion}} with his hand to tell the runners to move onto the paved path. Workers had just repaired a black crack on the road with sticky {{pitch}}, which made the ground dangerous. A runner was in a hurry, did not see the wet spot, and began to {{slip}} and {{slide}}. She had a sudden {{tumble}} on the grass, but Leo ran forward to help before she could {{knock}} her head.\n\nLuckily, the medical team had a {{mobile}} cart to check on her, and she was not hurt. Leo decided to {{throw}} a soft mat over the area so no one else would fall. Soon, the rain stopped, and the ice rink opened. Children loved to {{skate}} and {{glide}} smoothly across the frozen floor, while a poster on the wall invited people to {{ski}} in the mountains next winter. On the road outside, a long {{cycling}} race began.\n\nAt the end of the day, a {{famous}} runner arrived to present the trophy. This {{well-known}} sports star smiled warmly at the new young {{champion}}. Everyone cheered loudly, happy to share their love of sport together.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 人们聚集在体育中心进行训练、比赛，并享受不同的运动项目。\n\n里奥是一名年轻的运动员，梦想着有一天能加入奥运会队伍。这个周末，他所在的城镇举办了一场盛大的体育锦标赛。一位富有的当地赞助人和一家企业赞助商为奖项提供了资金。每位观众都坐在巨大的体育场里观看这场公开比赛。一位热心的志愿者分发着水瓶，为大家解暑降温。\n\n镇中心既有一个室内大厅，也有一个室外公园。在温暖的健身房里，年长的选手们在绿色的球台上享受着安静的国际象棋和台球对局。附近，人们做着舒缓的瑜伽来放松身心，小心翼翼地花时间伸展手臂，以免拉伤任何肌肉。其他人则更喜欢用大重量进行高强度的锻炼，与此同时，一位精力充沛的教练正带领大家进行快节奏的肢体动作课。里奥在每天早上的日常训练中，都会看着他们进行锻炼。\n\n在室外，宽阔延展的草坪上同时进行着多项运动。其中一片场地被布置成了足球场，球员们飞快地奔跑着去踢球，攻入了一记漂亮的进球。在他们旁边，几支队伍隔着高网打排球，而另一群人则在草皮上打曲棍球。在角落里，选手们挥舞着沉重的球棒打板球，还有一些人则前往附近的果岭练习高尔夫。拿着轻巧球拍的选手们在羽毛球和网球比赛之间穿梭往返。里奥不得不通过抛硬币来开始每场比赛，看着硬币在空中高高地翻转。\n\n突然，乌云密布。里奥不得不挥手打手势，示意跑步选手们移步到铺砌的小路上。工人们刚刚用黏稠的沥青修补了路面上的一道黑色裂缝，这让地面变得很危险。一名跑步选手行色匆匆，没有注意到潮湿的地方，开始打滑并滑倒。她突然在草地上跌倒了，但里奥立刻冲上前去帮忙，避免了她的头被撞到。\n\n幸运的是，医疗队有一辆移动车来为她进行检查，她并没有受伤。里奥决定在那个区域扔下一块软垫，这样其他人就不会摔倒了。很快，雨停了，溜冰场也开放了。孩子们喜欢在结冰的地面上顺畅地滑冰和滑行，而墙上的一张海报则邀请人们在下一个冬天去山里滑雪。在外面的道路上，一场长距离自行车赛拉开了帷幕。\n\n临近尾声时，一位著名的长跑选手赶来颁发奖杯。这位家喻户晓的体育明星对这位年轻的新冠军报以热情的微笑。大家大声欢呼，为能够共同分享对体育的热爱而感到无比快乐。",
