    "articleEn": "Theme: Friends enjoy outdoor activities during a summer trip by the lake.\n\nLeo was very excited because his summer {{vacation}} had finally started. Together with his friends, he arrived at a sunny forest {{camp}} near a clear blue lake. A friendly park guide gave a polite {{bow}} to greet the group before their day {{excursion}} began. The friends worked together under the warm sun to build each sleeping {{tent}} on the soft grass.\n\nBefore noon, they decided to prepare a meal. Leo’s sister liked to {{jog}} along the flat dirt road to stay active, while the others set out fruit and sandwiches for a lovely {{picnic}}. “We need dry wood for the fire tonight,” the guide said. Leo went to {{hunt}} for fallen branches in the woods. He had to {{bend}} down near the tall bushes to find dry wood, and then {{drag}} the thick branches back to the path. His friend helped him {{pull}} the heaviest log across the grass.\n\nAfter lunch, the group started a steep {{hike}} toward a high lookout point. Near the main gate, a lonely {{pedestrian}} waved hello to them from the sidewalk. The guide told everyone to keep a steady {{pace}} so they would not get tired early. Leo watched every single {{step}} carefully because he did not want to {{trip}} over exposed tree roots. “Do not {{stride}} too fast,” the guide warned, “because a steep climb can feel like a hard {{marathon}}.” One boy attempted a fast {{race}} to the top, but his tired legs caused him to {{lag}} behind the others. Still, they helped each other {{climb}} the rocky trail.\n\nAt the top of the ridge, the view was beautiful. The hikers made sure not to {{wander}} into dangerous bushes, and they did not {{linger}} in the hot sun for too long. Suddenly, a wild rabbit made a quick {{leap}} from behind a bush and began to {{hop}} down the rocky hillside. Right behind it, a small rubber ball fell from Leo’s bag and started to {{bounce}} down the path. Leo had to {{jump}} over a puddle to stop it, while a tiny frog made a sudden {{spring}} into the tall grass.\n\nIn the afternoon, they returned to the cool lake to relax. They watched large tour boats {{cruise}} across the water, and colorful fallen leaves begin to {{drift}} gently with the gentle waves. The weather was hot, so Leo was ready to {{plunge}} into the clear water. Standing on the wooden pier, he took a breath and decided to {{dive}} straight in. It was the perfect ending to an amazing outdoor adventure.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 朋友们在湖边的夏日旅行中享受户外活动。\n\n里奥非常兴奋，因为他的暑假终于开始了。他和朋友们一起来到了一个阳光明媚的森林营地，旁边是一片清澈蔚蓝的湖泊。在他们的一日远足开始之前，一位友善的公园向导礼貌地鞠躬向大家问好。朋友们在温暖的阳光下齐心协力，在柔软的草地上搭起了睡觉用的帐篷。\n\n中午前，他们决定准备一顿饭。里奥的妹妹喜欢沿着平坦的泥土路慢跑来保持活力，而其他人则摆出水果和三明治，准备享受一顿惬意的野餐。“我们今晚需要干柴生火，”向导说。里奥便去树林里搜寻掉落的树枝。他不得不高大灌木丛旁弯腰寻找干柴，然后把粗树枝拖回到小路上。他的朋友帮他把最重的一根木头拉过草地。\n\n午饭后，一行人开始了一段陡峭的徒步，前往一个高处的观景点。在大门附近，人行道上一位形单影只的行人向他们挥手致意。向导告诉大家要保持稳定的步调，这样才不会过早感到疲劳。里奥小心翼翼地看清脚下的每一步，因为他不想被裸露在外的树根绊倒。“不要大步快走，”向导提醒道，“因为陡峭的攀爬会让人感觉像是一场艰苦的马拉松。”一个小男孩试图通过快速奔跑冲向山顶，但他疲惫的双腿却导致他落后在其他人后面。不过，他们依然互相帮助，一起攀登这条崎岖不平的小道。\n\n在山脊顶端，景色十分美丽。徒步者们确保自己不漫步走入危险的灌木丛，也没有在烈日下逗留太久。突然，一只野兔从灌木丛后敏捷地跃起，开始沿着布满岩石的山坡单足跳跃。紧接着，一个小橡胶球从里奥的包里掉了出来，开始沿着小径弹跳。里奥不得不跳过一个水坑去拦住它，而一只小青蛙则突然跳跃进了茂密的草丛中。\n\n下午，他们回到凉爽的湖边放松。他们看着大型游船在水面上巡航，五彩斑斓的落叶随着轻柔的波浪缓缓漂流。天气很热，所以里奥准备纵身跃入清澈的水中。站在木质码头上，他深吸了一口气，决定直接潜水进去。这是一场精彩户外冒险的完美结局。",
