    "articleEn": "Theme: A man finishes an important office project at home when the power suddenly goes out.\n\nEarly in the morning, Leo woke up on his comfortable {{mattress}}. He pushed off the heavy {{quilt}}, pulled back the warm {{blanket}}, and straightened the white {{sheet}} and soft {{pillow}}. He stepped across the bedroom {{carpet}} onto a small wool {{rug}}, then paused on the bathroom {{mat}}. In front of the mirror, he picked up a {{razor}} to {{shave}} carefully. Afterward, he dried his face with a clean {{towel}} and wiped the counter with a damp {{sponge}}.\n\nSuddenly, the bathroom lights flickered and died with a quiet click. An electrical {{fuse}} had blown in the hallway. Leo walked into the kitchen, took a wooden {{match}} from a box, and lit a tall {{candle}}. He watched the melted {{wax}} slowly drip down to the curved {{rim}} of the dish. Looking under his work table, he checked the main computer {{cable}} and the thin lamp {{cord}}. He noticed one damaged {{strand}} of wire was exposed, which had caused the short circuit.\n\nLeo had important papers to prepare before noon, so he sat down on a soft chair {{cushion}} by candlelight. He reached into his {{stationery}} drawer to gather his supplies. He placed a writing {{pad}} on the desk, along with a bottle of black {{ink}}, a soft {{rubber}} eraser, a small metal {{staple}}, and a tube of clear {{glue}}. He even pulled out a small {{nail}} to pierce holes in thick paper boards.\n\nHis task was to assemble a business {{memorandum}}, a short information {{pamphlet}}, and a pocket {{paperback}} guide. Since the electricity was gone, he could not use an office {{Xerox}} machine to print another set. Instead, he had to create an exact {{duplicate}} by hand. Leo had to {{shear}} through stiff cardboard to make binders, and then he used a pair of sharp {{scissors}} to trim along every rough {{edge}}.\n\nA single drop of ink spilled near his desk, but Leo quickly caught it with a dry {{tissue}} before it caused damage. At last, he decorated the front {{cover}} of each booklet and slipped everything neatly into his leather {{portfolio}}. He blew out the flame and smiled, ready for the busy day ahead.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 一名男子在家中突遇停电，却依然坚持完成了一项重要的办公项目。\n\n清晨，利奥从舒适的床垫上醒来。他推开厚重的被子，拉开温暖的毯子，整理好白色的床单和柔软的枕头。他穿过卧室的地毯，踩上一块小小的羊毛小地毯，接着在浴室的地垫上停下脚步。在镜子前，他拿起一把剃须刀，仔细地刮胡子。随后，他用一条干净的毛巾擦干了脸，又用一块湿润的海绵擦净了台面。\n\n突然，浴室的灯闪烁了几下，伴随着轻微的咔哒声熄灭了。走廊里的一个电气保险丝烧断了。利奥走进厨房，从盒子里拿出一根木质火柴，点燃了一支高高的蜡烛。他注视着融化的蜡缓缓滴落在盘子弯曲的边缘上。他查看了工作台下方，检查了电脑的主电缆和细细的台灯电线。他注意到有一股受损的电线裸露在外，正是它导致了短路。\n\n利奥在中午前有重要文件需要准备，于是他在烛光下坐到了柔软的椅子坐垫上。他把手伸进文具抽屉里收集用品。他在桌上放了一个书写便签本，还有一瓶黑色墨水、一块柔软的橡胶橡皮擦、一枚小小的金属订书钉以及一管透明胶水。他甚至找出一枚小钉子，用来在厚纸板上扎孔。\n\n他的任务是装订一份商务备忘录、一本简短的信息小册子和一本口袋平装书指南。由于停电，他无法使用办公室的施乐复印机来加印一套。相反，他必须手工制作出一份一模一样的副本。利奥不得不剪切硬纸板来制作文件夹，然后用一把锋利的剪刀修剪每一个粗糙的边缘。\n\n一滴墨水洒在了他的书桌旁，但利奥在它造成污损前迅速用干纸巾吸干了。最后，他装饰了每本小册子的前封面，并将所有东西整齐地滑入自己的皮革公文包中。他吹灭了烛火，微笑着准备迎接即将到来的忙碌一天。",
