    "articleEn": "Theme: A caretaker secures an old workshop and house before a storm.\n\nTom wore his yellow {{raincoat}} and held an {{umbrella}} as rain began to fall near the old stone estate. He worked as an inspector, wearing an official silver {{badge}} on his coat. A tall wire {{fence}} stood around the property, separating the yard from an old abandoned coal {{mine}} and a deep mud {{pit}}. Out back, workers used a {{dredge}} machine to clear a stream, while piles of wet {{lumber}} rested under a tarp. Tom knew that time was an important {{factor}} today because bad weather was approaching fast.\n\nHe walked toward the main entrance to inspect the building envelope. The thick walls were constructed from heavy {{cement}}, white {{lime}}, and smooth interior {{plaster}}, with black waterproof {{pitch}} painted along the foundation. Outside, Tom set up a tall {{ladder}} to secure a rattling window {{shutter}}, then stepped onto a small {{stool}} to examine a cracked window {{pane}}. Years of dirt had given the glass high {{opacity}}, so almost no natural daylight reached the room inside. Behind it, a dark {{curtain}} hung still. Tom loosened the metal {{bolt}} on the heavy entrance, turned the round brass {{knob}}, and pushed the door open.\n\nInside stood a historic workshop that once housed a grain {{mill}} and a hot blacksmith {{forge}}. Here, early craftsmen used to shape many kinds of {{metal}}, including pure {{iron}}, soft {{lead}}, golden {{brass}}, and artistic {{bronze}}. Near the wall, Tom examined an old gear made from a tough steel {{alloy}}. He needed to {{lubricate}} a stiff foot {{pedal}} so the machine turned freely without screeching. Walking past a low training {{hurdle}} left on the floor, he picked up an oil {{can}}, added fresh {{fuel}} to the backup generator, and carefully tested every electrical {{element}} to prepare for power cuts.\n\nNext, Tom inspected the storage room. A sturdy {{wooden}} table held a small glass {{jar}} of screws, an old wooden {{barrel}}, an empty water {{bucket}}, and a heavy metal {{pail}}. Along the wall, every high {{shelf}} and slide-out {{drawer}} carried a clean paper {{label}} and a numbered {{tag}}. The room held rolls of strong {{canvas}}, soft white {{linen}}, light {{cotton}}, and tough blue {{nylon}}, next to jackets made of warm {{leather}}. Old sample cards demonstrated how weavers used to {{knit}} yarn and {{weave}} plant {{fiber}} into warm {{fabric}}. Tom placed loose screws into small {{plastic}} boxes and filed them by storage {{section}}.\n\nTom then moved into the caretaker’s living quarters. He flipped a wall {{switch}}, and a bright overhead {{bulb}} lit up the room. A large kitchen {{refrigerator}} kept food cold, while a mini {{fridge}} beside it stayed clean and empty. In the corner, an upright {{vacuum}} cleaner stood beside an electric cooling {{fan}}. To stay ready for the storm, Tom turned on a small {{portable}} radio. He also gathered a strong handheld {{flashlight}}, an emergency oil {{lantern}}, and a wide-beam {{spotlight}}. On the desk, he placed his digital {{camera}} next to the landline {{phone}} and an old emergency {{bell}}.\n\nBefore locking up, Tom helped an elderly worker {{lift}} a heavy wooden chest. Inside, safely wrapped in velvet, lay a sparkling mineral {{crystal}} and a tiny polished {{diamond}} from the valley’s old collection. Satisfied with his work, Tom pulled each door {{handle}} shut and secured the locks. The old workshop was fully ready for the long night.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 暴风雨来临前，看管人加固老作坊与房屋。\n\n当雨水开始落在这座古老的石砌庄园附近时，汤姆穿上了黄色雨衣，撑起一把雨伞。他是一名检查员，外套上佩戴着一枚官方银色徽章。庄园周围立着高高的铁丝栅栏，将院子与一座废弃的老煤矿和一个深泥坑隔开。在后院，工人们正使用一台挖泥机清理溪流，而一堆堆潮湿的木材则放置在防水布下。汤姆知道，由于恶劣天气正快速逼近，时间是今天的一个重要因素。\n\n他走向正门去检查建筑外立面。厚实的墙体由笨重的水泥、白石灰以及光滑的室内灰泥筑成，地基沿线涂抹着黑色的防水沥青。在室外，汤姆架起一架高梯子以固定一面咔咔作响的百叶窗扇，然后踩上一只小凳子去检查一块破裂的窗格玻璃。多年的污垢使玻璃具有很高的不透明度，因此几乎没有自然日光能照进室内的房间。窗后，一面深色窗帘静静地垂着。汤姆松开厚重正门上的金属插销，转动黄铜圆门把手，推开了大门。\n\n里面是一间历史悠久的作坊，这里曾设有一座谷物磨坊和一个炙热的铁匠锻炉。早期的工匠们曾在这里锻造多种金属，包括纯铁、软铅、金黄色的黄铜和富有艺术感的青铜。在靠近墙壁的地方，汤姆检查了一个由坚硬钢合金制成的老齿轮。他需要润滑一个僵硬的脚踏板，以便机器能够顺畅转动而不发出刺耳的尖叫声。跨过遗留在地板上的一具低矮训练跨栏，他拿起一个油罐，为备用发电机添加了新鲜燃料，并仔细测试了每一个电气元件，以应对停电。\n\n随后，汤姆检查了储藏室。一张结实的木制桌子上放着一小罐螺丝、一个旧木桶、一个空水桶和一个沉重的金属提桶。沿着墙壁，每个高架子和抽出式抽屉上都贴着整洁的纸质标签和带有编号的标牌。房间里放有一卷卷结实的帆布、柔软的白亚麻布、轻便的棉布和坚韧的蓝色尼龙，旁边放着保暖皮革制成的夹克。陈旧的样品卡展示了昔日织工如何将纱线编织，并将植物纤维织成温暖的织物。汤姆把零散的螺丝装进小塑料盒中，并按存放分区归档归类。\n\n接着，汤姆走进了看管人的起居区。他按了一下墙上的开关，一盏明亮的顶置灯泡照亮了房间。一台大型厨房冰箱用于食物保鲜，而旁边的小冰箱则保持着干净排空的状态。在角落里，一台立式吸尘器立在一台电风扇旁。为了随时防范风暴，汤姆打开了一台小型便携式收音机。他还收集了一只强光手持手电筒、一盏应急油灯和一具宽光束聚光灯。在书桌上，他将数码相机放在座机电话和一只旧应急警铃旁边。\n\n在锁门之前，汤姆帮一位年长的工人抬起了一个沉重的木箱。木箱内部用天鹅绒妥善包裹着一块闪闪发光的矿物晶体和一颗采自该山谷早期收藏的精磨小钻石。汤姆对自己的工作感到满意，拉合各个门把手并锁好门锁。这座古老的作坊已经做好了全面准备，迎接漫漫长夜。",
