    "articleEn": "Theme: A designer creates a stunning outfit for a glamorous star at a famous ball.\n\nClara worked in a busy design studio in the heart of the city. Tonight was the night of the grand annual {{masquerade}}, an event where wealthy guests celebrated the very best in modern {{fashion}}. The {{current}} {{trend}} among young partygoers was to copy their favorite celebrities. There was a clear {{tendency}} to show off wealth in public, and {{extravagant}} outfits always seemed to {{prevail}} over quiet elegance. Clara’s studio worked day and night because this night would decide their {{popularity}} for the rest of the year.\n\nHer most famous client was a young woman named Maya. Maya was an international runway {{model}} and a global fashion {{icon}}. To millions of teenagers online, she was a true {{idol}} whose every outfit became an instant hit. Her personal {{style}} was so famous that whatever she wore immediately came into {{vogue}}. For this party, Maya did not want something ordinary. She wanted to look like an ancient queen, wrapped in total {{luxury}} that would amaze the entire city.\n\nClara began working on the special {{costume}} early in the morning. First, she needed to produce the rich shades of royal blue that Maya requested. She mixed a deep natural {{pigment}} into hot water and carefully applied the dark blue {{dye}} across yards of white silk. After the fabric dried, Clara sat by the window with a silver needle to {{embroider}} flying birds across the chest. Then, she used fine golden threads to {{embellish}} the sleeves with detailed patterns.\n\nNext came the most delicate part of the dress. Clara loved to {{adorn}} fine clothes with precious stones. Maya had brought several boxes of expensive {{jewelry}} to the studio. Clara chose a smooth green {{jade}} stone for the belt and fixed a bright red {{jewel}} near the collar. Every single {{gem}} shone brightly under the studio lights. To bring the whole look together, Clara added a small silver {{ornament}} shaped like a flower near the waist.\n\nJust two hours before the party, Maya arrived for the final touches. A salon team finished her {{hairdressing}}, lifting her dark hair into an elegant crown. Finally, Clara placed a sheer black {{veil}} over Maya’s eyes to complete the mysterious look. When Maya walked into the ballroom that evening, the whole room went silent with wonder. The design was a huge success, proving that real beauty was more than just money.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 设计师在著名舞会上为一位魅力四射的明星打造了一套令人惊叹的盛装。\n\n克拉拉在市中心一家繁忙的设计工作室工作。今晚是一年一度盛大化装舞会的举办之夜，富有的客人们将在此共庆现代时尚的极致魅力。年轻派对宾客中当前的****潮流是模仿他们最喜欢的名人。公开炫富有着明显的倾向，而铺张奢华的盛装似乎总是压倒低调的优雅。克拉拉的工作室日夜奋战，因为今晚将决定他们在今年剩余时间里的声望。\n\n她最著名的客户是一位名叫玛雅的年轻女子。玛雅是一名国际T台模特，也是一位全球时尚偶像。对于网上的数百万青少年来说，她是一个真正的偶像，她的每一套穿搭都能瞬间走红。她的个人风格名气极大，无论她穿什么都会立刻成为风尚。对于这次派对，玛雅不想要普通的东西。她想看起来像一位古代女王，浑身散发着纯粹的奢华，让整座城市为之惊叹。\n\n克拉拉清晨便开始制作这套特别的服装。首先，她需要调配出玛雅要求的浓郁皇家蓝。她将一种深色的天然颜料混入热水中，小心翼翼地把这种深蓝色染料涂抹在数码长的白丝绸上。待面料晾干后，克拉拉拿着银针坐在窗前，在胸口处刺绣飞鸟图案。随后，她用精致的金线在袖口装饰上细腻的花纹。\n\n接下来是这件礼服最精细的部分。克拉拉喜欢用宝石来装饰华服。玛雅带了好几盒昂贵的珠宝来到工作室。克拉拉选了一块温润的绿玉作为腰带配饰，并在衣领附近固定了一颗鲜红的宝石。每一颗宝石在工作室的灯光下都熠熠生辉。为了让整体造型融为一体，克拉拉在腰部附近添加了一件小巧的花朵状银质饰品。\n\n就在派对开始前两小时，玛雅赶来完成最后的润色。美发团队做好了她的美发，将她乌黑的秀发盘成优雅的王冠造型。最后，克拉拉在玛雅的眼前蒙上一层轻薄的黑色面纱，完成了这一神秘的造型。当玛雅当晚步入宴会厅时，全场因惊叹而鸦雀无声。这项设计大获成功，证明了真正的美远不止金钱本身。",
