    "articleEn": "Theme: Choosing the right clothes and getting ready for a special evening.\n\nClara stood by the bedroom window on a chilly Saturday morning. She wrapped herself in a soft {{robe}} and drank some hot tea. Tonight was the annual community charity gala, and she felt nervous. Beautiful fashion magazines always {{fascinate}} her, but when she opened her own {{wardrobe}}, she felt disappointed. Half of her best clothes were unwashed in a giant basket of {{laundry}}, waiting for the washing machine.\n\nShe had to find a way to {{clothe}} herself in something truly {{decent}} for the celebration. Right now, she saw only ordinary everyday clothes on the hangers. There was a simple blue {{skirt}}, two pairs of casual {{jeans}}, formal black {{trousers}}, and a thick knitted {{sweater}}. In the corner, there was even a stained painter’s {{overall}} and an old school {{uniform}} from her teenage years. In her eyes, these everyday items looked completely {{ugly}} for an important dinner party.\n\nThen, Clara remembered the back of her closet. She pulled away some hangers and discovered a long bag containing an {{exquisite}} evening {{gown}}. This special silk {{garment}} had an aura of natural {{elegance}} and silent {{grace}}. It was completely untouched by dust. Above it hung a stylish black {{jacket}} and a warm winter {{overcoat}} to protect her from the cold wind outside. It was a very {{pretty}} sight, and Clara knew instantly that this outfit was {{perfect}}.\n\nNext, she sat down at her small table to focus on her personal {{appearance}}. Clara opened a drawer filled with various bottles of {{cosmetics}}. With a light brush and gentle touches of color, she applied fresh, subtle {{make-up}} to her cheeks and lips. Looking in the mirror, she no longer felt tired or stressed; she felt truly {{beautiful}} and confident.\n\nA knock at the door signaled that her date had arrived. Clara stepped into the living room wearing her special {{dress}}. Mark stood at the door looking tall and {{handsome}} in a dark suit. He gave her a bouquet of white roses with a polite, {{charming}} smile. Seeing her ready for the night, Mark took her hand, and they walked happily out into the evening together.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 挑选合适的服饰，为一个特别的夜晚做准备。\n\n在一个寒冷的周六早晨，克拉拉站在卧室窗前。她裹着一件柔软的晨袍，喝着热茶。今晚是一年一度的社区慈善晚会，她感到有些紧张。漂亮的时尚杂志总是让她着迷，但当她打开自己的衣柜时，却感到一阵失望。她最好的衣服有一半还没洗，堆在一个巨大的待洗衣物筐里，正等着被放进洗衣机。\n\n她必须想办法为自己穿上一件真正得体的衣服去参加庆祝活动。此刻，她看到的衣架上只有普通的日常便服。有一条简单的蓝色半身裙、两条休闲牛仔裤、一条正式的黑色长裤，还有一件厚厚的针织毛衣。在角落里，甚至还有一件沾有污渍的画家工作服和一套她青少年时期的旧校服。在她看来，要把这些日常衣物穿去参加重要晚宴，简直是丑陋至极。\n\n这时，克拉拉想起了衣橱的深处。她移开一些衣架，发现了一个长袋子，里面装着一件精美绝伦的晚礼服。这件特殊的丝绸服装散发着一种浑然天成的高雅与静谧的优美。它完全没有沾染任何灰尘。礼服上方挂着一件时髦的黑色短外套和一件保暖的冬季大衣，足以抵御室外的寒风。这真是一幅极美的画面，克拉拉立刻明白，这套服饰是完美的。\n\n接着，她在小桌旁坐下，专注于自己的个人容貌。克拉拉打开了一个装满各种瓶装化妆品的抽屉。她用轻巧的刷子点缀上柔和的色彩，在脸颊和嘴唇上化了清新淡雅的妆容。看着镜中的自己，她不再感到疲惫或压力重重，而是觉得自己真正美丽且充满自信。\n\n敲门声响起，表明她的男伴已经到了。克拉拉穿着她特别的连衣裙走进了客厅。马克身穿一套深色西装站在门前，显得身材高大且英俊。他带着礼貌而迷人的微笑，递给她一束白玫瑰。看到她已经为今晚做好了准备，马克牵起她的手，两人开开心心地一同迈入了夜色之中。",
