    "articleEn": "Theme: A young man chooses the right accessories to stay warm on a freezing day.\n\nWinter had arrived in the city, and the morning air was bitterly cold. Leo stood in front of his hallway mirror, getting ready to leave for his new job. The weather report warned that strong winds would blow across the streets all day. On his bed lay a thick coat, several warm accessories, and two choices for headwear: a casual {{cap}} and a heavy wool {{hat}}.\n\nLeo started with his heavy winter coat. The icy wind always found a way through small openings, so he took time to carefully {{button}} the front from the bottom up to his chest. Near the neck, the coat had a special metal {{clasp}} to keep the collar closed tightly. He pressed the two metal pieces together until he heard a soft click. Now, the wind could not reach his chest.\n\nNext, Leo picked up his long wool {{scarf}}. It was bright yellow, a gift from his grandmother. He wrapped it twice around his neck and tucked the ends neatly under his coat collar. The soft fabric immediately made him feel warm and comfortable. He looked in the mirror again, but he knew his outfit was not finished yet.\n\nHe looked back at the bed. A simple {{cap}} was fine for a sunny afternoon, but it would not protect his ears today. Instead, he chose the thick winter {{hat}}. It was sturdy, with a firm {{brim}} that could shield his eyes from the freezing wind and light snow. He placed it on his head and pulled the {{brim}} down slightly to keep his forehead warm.\n\nFinally, Leo prepared his hands. He picked up one leather {{glove}} from the table, but the second one was missing. After looking around, he saw it lying on the rug near the door. He put on each {{glove}}, picked up his bag, and opened the front door with confidence, fully protected against the winter chill.",
    "articleZh": "主题： 一名年轻男子在寒冷的日子里挑选合适的配饰来保暖。\n\n冬天已经降临这座城市，清晨的空气刺骨冰凉。利奥站在门厅的镜子前，正准备出发去他的新岗位。天气预报警告说，整天都会有强风刮过街道。他的床上放着一件厚大衣、几件保暖配饰，以及两顶可供选择的头部佩戴物：一顶休闲鸭舌帽和一顶厚羊毛帽子。\n\n利奥先穿上了厚重的冬装大衣。冰冷的风总是能顺着细小的缝隙钻进来，所以他耐心地从下往上将胸前的扣子仔细地扣上。靠近颈部的地方，大衣配有一个特殊的金属搭扣，可以把衣领紧紧扣合。他把两个金属部件压在一起，直到听见一声轻微的咔嗒声。现在，风就吹不到他的胸口了。\n\n接着，利奥拿起了他的羊毛长围巾。那是祖母送的一件礼物，亮黄色的。他将它在脖子上绕了两圈，并将两端整齐地塞入大衣领口下方。柔软的面料立刻让他感到温暖舒适。他又看了看镜子，但他知道自己的行头还没有准备完全。\n\n他回头看向床铺。一顶普通的鸭舌帽在阳光明媚的下午戴戴还行，但今天可护不住他的耳朵。于是，他选择了那顶厚实的冬用帽子。这顶帽子很结实，带有坚挺的帽檐，可以挡住刺骨的寒风和小雪以保护他的眼睛。他将它戴在头上，并稍稍往下拉了拉帽檐，以护住额头保暖。\n\n最后，利奥开始武装双手。他从桌上拿起了一只皮手套，但另一只却不见了。环顾四周后，他看到它正躺在门边的小地毯上。他戴好每一只手套，拿起包，自信满满地打开了前门，完全做好了抵御严冬寒气的准备。",
